\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Overview of the four-stage \emph  {Laminar-JEPA} and compact \emph  {Laminar-JEPA-Lite} pipeline: \textbf  {(1)}\nobreakspace  {}sliding window ($C{=}256, S \in \{1..64\}$) and dual encoders ($E_\theta , E_\phi $) with conditional rFFT splitting ($K{\ge }25$ in Lite), barycenter centering, and LayerNorm; \textbf  {(2)}\nobreakspace  {}multi-horizon rollout ($M{=}4$ sequential in full \emph  {Laminar-JEPA}; $M{=}3$ parallel single-LayerNorm in \emph  {Lite}) under variance-floor and decorrelation loss plus resolvent whitening into $\tilde  {\mathbf  {E}} \in \mathbb  {R}^{M \times 32}$; \textbf  {(3)}\nobreakspace  {}horizon expansion into $7 \times 32 = 224$ dials (full) or $4 \times 32 = 128$ position-plus-drift dials (\emph  {Lite}); and \textbf  {(4)}\nobreakspace  {}per-dial Boolean circuit breakers emitting causal ($\tau {=}t{+}S{-}1$) or prefix-buffered alarms.}}{4}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
